<div class="nyc" aria-label="New York studio">
  <div class="sec-head reveal">
    <div><div class="kicker">Find us — SoHo, NYC</div><h2 class="sec-title">Made in<br /><em>New York</em></h2></div>
    <p>148 Grand St, 4th Floor. Walk-ins for coffee on Fridays. Same timezone as you (probably) — same energy, always.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="nyc-grid">
    <div class="nyc-card map reveal" data-hover>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496442226666-8d4d0e62e6e9?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="New York City aerial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <div class="nyc-pin"><div class="dot"></div><div class="label">● KINETIC — 148 Grand St, SoHo</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="nyc-card nyc-info reveal">
      <small style="font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--lime)">● LOCAL TIME — NEW YORK (EST)</small>
      <div data-clock-full id="nycClock">00:00:00</div>
      <div class="nyc-meta">
        <div><small>Studio</small><b>148 Grand St, 4F<br />New York, NY 10013</b></div>
        <div><small>New business</small><b>hello@kinetic.nyc<br />+1 212 555 0147</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-row">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Team member" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?w=200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Team member" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Team member" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?w=200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Team member" loading="lazy" />
        <div>+20 more humans<br />in-studio &amp; remote</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
